    "dynamic_instructions": "{\r\n  \"datasetView\": \"#Trace a Mistake \\n\\nLet's examine all of the training data.\\n\\nClick on the **Filter** button and choose:\\n\\n> Clip Type: Behind the Scenes  \\n\\nCount how many pieces of training data are present for this _clip type_. What does the data say about the **Result**?\",\r\n  \"results\": \"#Trace a Mistake \\n\\nFollow along with you teacher to learn how to trace a mistake back to its training data.\\n\\n\\nStep One - Make a prediction with these features:\\n\\n>**Clip Type**: Behind the Scenes  \\n> **Length**: Short  \\n> **Famous Actor**: Yes  \\n> **Funny**: Yes  \\n\\nStep Two - Click the **Replay** button to trace the path through the tree.\\n\\nStep Three - Check the training data by clicking the _decision node_ and clicking on **Training rows**.\"\r\n}",
    "teacher_markdown": "- Follow along with your teacher.\r\n- Enter the dance clip in **Make a Prediction**: Behind the Scenes, Short, Famous Actor Yes, Funny Yes.\r\n- Press **Predict**.\r\n- Press **Replay**.\r\n- Open the last step of the path.\r\n- Read its training records.",
    "bubble_choice_description": "- Click **Filter** and choose Clip Type: Behind the Scenes.\r\n- Count how many clips are Hits and how many are Meh.\r\n- Write what you found in the Together row of your guide."
